{
  "text": "```verilog\nmodule apbslave #(\n\tparameter\tC_APB_ADDR_WIDTH = 12,\n\tparameter\tC_APB_DATA_WIDTH = 32,\n\tlocalparam\tAW = C_APB_ADDR_WIDTH,\n\tlocalparam\tDW = C_APB_DATA_WIDTH,\n\tlocalparam\tAPBLSB = $clog2(C_APB_DATA_WIDTH)-3\n) (\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPCLK, PRESETn,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPSEL,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPENABLE,\n\toutput\treg\t\t\tPREADY,\n\tinput\twire\t\t[AW-1:0]\tPADDR,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPWRITE,\n\tinput\twire\t\t[DW-1:0]\tPWDATA,\n\tinput\twire\t\t[DW/8-1:0]\tPWSTRB,\n\tinput\twire\t\t[2:0]\t\tPPROT,\n\toutput\treg\t\t[DW-1:0]\tPRDATA,\n\toutput\twire\t\t\tPSLVERR\n);\n\n\tlocalparam\tNUM_BYTES = DW/8;\n\tlocalparam\tNUM_BYTES_LOG = $clog2(NUM_BYTES);\n\n\treg\t[AW-1:0]\tADDR_REG;\n\treg\t[DW-1:0]\tDATA_REG;\n\treg\t\t\tWRITE_ENABLE;\n\treg\t\t\tSTATE; // 0: IDLE, 1: ACCESS\n\treg\t\t\tVALID;\n\treg\t\t\tSTRB_VALID;\n\treg\t[APBLSB:0]\tSTRB_MASK;\n\treg\t\t\tPSLVERR_INT;\n\n\t// State Machine\n\talways @(posedge PCLK or negedge PRESETn) begin\n\t\tif (!PRESETn) begin\n\t\t\tADDR_REG <= 0;\n\t\t\tDATA_REG <= 0;\n\t\t\tWRITE_ENABLE <= 0;\n\t\t\tSTATE <= 0;\n\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tPRDATA <= 0;\n\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tVALID <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tSTRB_VALID <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tSTRB_MASK <= 0;\n\t\t\tPSLVERR_INT <= 1'b0;\n\t\tend\n\t\telse begin\n\t\t\tif (PSEL && PENABLE) begin\n\t\t\t\t// Setup Phase\n\t\t\t\tif (!PREADY) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t// Slave not ready, keep PREADY low\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\t\t// Slave ready, capture address and control\n\t\t\t\t\tADDR_REG <= PADDR;\n\t\t\t\t\tWRITE_ENABLE <= PWRITE;\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t// Check for strobe validity\n\t\t\t\t\tif (PWRITE) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t// Write strobe must be valid\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif (PWSTRB == 0) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPSLVERR_INT <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSTRB_VALID <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSTRB_MASK <= PWSTRB;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t// Read operation, no strobe needed\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSTRB_VALID <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSTRB_MASK <= 0;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\t\t\t// Transition to Access Phase\n\t\t\t\t\tSTATE <= 1;\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tVALID <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\t// No select or no enable\n\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\tVALID <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\tSTRB_VALID <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\tPSLVERR_INT <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Data Output Logic\n\talways @(posedge PCLK or negedge PRESETn) begin\n\t\tif (!PRESETn) begin\n\t\t\tPRDATA <= 0;\n\t\tend\n\t\telse if (STATE == 1 && PENABLE && PREADY) begin\n\t\t\tif (WRITE_ENABLE) begin\n\t\t\t\t// Write operation\n\t\t\t\tif (STRB_VALID) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t// Apply byte mask\n\t\t\t\t\tDATA_REG <= DATA_REG & (~STRB_MASK) | (PWDATA & STRB_MASK);\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\t\t// Invalid write strobe\n\t\t\t\t\tPSLVERR_INT <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\t// Read operation\n\t\t\t\tPRDATA <= DATA_REG;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Error Output\n\tassign PSLVERR = PSEL && PENABLE && PREADY && PSLVERR_INT;\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>\n<|endoftext|>",
